      "message": "The 4th arg to `validateRefOperation` is `pushOptions` — the map that reaches plugin ref validators (`RefOperationValidationListener`, via `RefReceivedEvent.pushOptions`).\n\nHardcoding `ImmutableListMultimap.of()` means a caller\u0027s validation options never reach those validators, so this endpoint can\u0027t drive option-aware ref checks that `CreateBranch` (L182-186) and the push path can.\n\nThread the request\u0027s options instead: `ValidationOptionsUtil.getValidateOptionsAsMultimap(input.validationOptions)`.\n\nDepends on adding the `validationOptions` field to `CommitFilesInput` first.",
